<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Metcash half yr headline share up 24 pct.</title>
<headline>Metcash half yr headline share up 24 pct.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended October 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, headline (cts)   38.8	  vs   31.4</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 15.0	  vs   12.5</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   70.87	 vs   52.07</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   70.87	 vs   52.07</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		  117.25	 vs   88.24</p>
<p>    Tax			 40.58	 vs   35.39</p>
<p>    Interest received     24.73	 vs   22.04</p>
<p>    Turnover	     4,260.80	 vs 3,610.5</p>
<p>Full name: Metro Cash &amp; Carry Ltd (stores)</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it would issue capitalisation shares to shareholders on terms and conditions to be announced on or before December 9.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
